---
import Landing from '../layouts/Landing.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';
---

<Landing title={`Solutions and IP | ${SITE_TITLE}`} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}>

	<section class="lede wrapper">
		<div class="content tt">
			<h1 class="page-head">Solutions and IP</h1>
			<p>To deliver excellence to our clients we push the boundaries of what is possible. As a result we have invented and developed new technologies and approaches to typesetting on the web. We would love to work with you to implement these solutions into your next project.</p>
		</div>
	</section>
	
	<Nav />

	<main class="main wrapper">
		<div class="content">

			<h2 class="head">Integrating with our technology</h2>
			<p>We offer a highly configurable and flexible typographic framework for products. Whether it’s a website builder, publishing platform, or design system we would love to work with you to ensure your typography is flexible enough for all your customer’s needs.</p>

			<h2 class="head">Commission a new tool</h2>
			<p>If you have a typographic problem you need solved, we’d be happy to help you solve it. Creating waterfalls of text, fitting copy in a specific way, or working with a foundry to merge your design vision with the perfect font, we can help.</p>

			<h2 class="head">License our patent portfolio</h2>

			<h3 class="sub-head">Dynamic Typesetting</h3>
			<p class="eyebrow"><a href="https://image-ppubs.uspto.gov/dirsearch-public/print/downloadPdf/10769348">US Patent 10769348</a> and <a href="/patents">international patents</a></p>
			<p>This patent describes how typographic systems can be made to respond to layout shifts and distributed for use.</p>

			<h3 class="sub-head">Fluid Design Keyframes in a GUI</h3>
			<p class="eyebrow"><a href="https://image-ppubs.uspto.gov/dirsearch-public/print/downloadPdf/10592087">US Patent 10592087</a>
			<p>This patent describes an interface for defining keyframes at various widths and having the design interpolate between those widths.</p>

		</div>
	</main>
</Landing>